globalThis.IQLocalePacks=globalThis.IQLocalePacks||{};globalThis.IQLocalePacks.sw={"code":"sw","messages":{"Estimated median range":"Kiwango cha wastani kinachokadiriwa","Public comparisons include all contributors using this puzzle version. Optional age group and country are only used in private aggregate statistics.":"Ulinganisho wa umma unajumuisha wachangiaji wote wanaotumia toleo hili la mafumbo. Kundi la umri na nchi hiari hutumika tu katika takwimu za jumla za faragha.","I agree to contribute my anonymous question results, active times and any optional age group or country to aggregate statistics.":"Ninakubali kuchangia matokeo yangu ya swali lisilojulikana, nyakati zinazotumika na kundi lolote la umri hiari au nchi kwa takwimu za jumla.","Median ranges are estimated from time histograms. The displayed interval shows the timing resolution; no exact median or speed percentile is claimed.":"Viwango vya wastani vinakadiriwa kutoka kwa histogramu za muda. Kipindi kinachoonyeshwa kinaonyesha azimio la muda; hakuna asilimia halisi ya wastani au kasi inayodaiwa.","Share the challenge":"Shiriki changamoto","Question time":"Muda wa swali","Your browser privacy preferences keep these statistics on your device.":"Mapendeleo ya faragha ya kivinjari chako huweka takwimu hizi kwenye kifaa chako.","All voluntary attempts":"Majaribio yote ya hiari","Thank you. Your anonymous contribution was saved.":"Asante. Mchango wako usiojulikana umehifadhiwa.","There are not enough comparable attempts in this group yet. Your own statistics are always available.":"Bado hakuna majaribio ya kutosha yanayolingana katika kundi hili. Takwimu zako zinapatikana kila wakati.","Comparisons are temporarily unavailable. Your own statistics and sharing still work.":"Ulinganisho haupatikani kwa muda. Takwimu zako na ushiriki wako bado unafanya kazi.","This older attempt has no complete timing record. You can still explore and share your result.":"Jaribio hili la zamani halina rekodi kamili ya muda. Bado unaweza kuchunguza na kushiriki matokeo yako.","Choose whether to contribute before sending any data.":"Chagua kama utachangia kabla ya kutuma data yoyote.","This attempt has no complete timing record. Your personal results are unchanged.":"Jaribio hili halina rekodi kamili ya muda. Matokeo yako binafsi hayajabadilika.","Your contribution could not be saved in this browser. Nothing was sent.":"Mchango wako haukuweza kuhifadhiwa katika kivinjari hiki. Hakuna kilichotumwa.","This contribution needs review and was not counted again.":"Mchango huu unahitaji kukaguliwa na haukuhesabiwa tena.","Your contribution has not been confirmed. Try again with the same saved contribution.":"Mchango wako haujathibitishwa. Jaribu tena kwa mchango uleule uliohifadhiwa.","No account needed":"Hakuna akaunti inayohitajika","The test starts when you are ready":"Jaribio linaanza ukiwa tayari","Test":"Jaribio","Answered questions":"Maswali yaliyojibiwa","Something to share":"Kitu cha kushiriki","Your strongest moment":"Wakati wako wenye nguvu zaidi","Your estimated IQ":"Akili yako inayokadiriwa","A tricky puzzle, solved quickly":"Fumbo gumu, lililotatuliwa haraka","Quicker than the typical correct answer":"Haraka kuliko jibu sahihi la kawaida","Your quickest correct answer":"Jibu lako sahihi la haraka zaidi","Patterns you solved":"Mifumo uliyotatua","A challenge worth sharing":"Changamoto inayofaa kushiriki","36 puzzles. One challenge.":"Fumbo 36. Changamoto moja.","Share a challenge with someone you know.":"Shiriki changamoto na mtu unayemjua.","Your own active time. There is not enough comparison data to rank its speed.":"Muda wako wa kufanya kazi. Hakuna data ya kulinganisha ya kutosha kupanga kasi yake.","Choose what to share":"Chagua cha kushiriki","Best moment":"Wakati bora zaidi","IQ estimate":"Makadirio ya IQ","Correct patterns":"Miundo sahihi","Share on Facebook":"Shiriki kwenye Facebook","Copy a personal caption":"Nakili maelezo ya kibinafsi","Your share text":"Maandishi yako ya kushiriki","Copy text":"Nakili maandishi","Facebook lets you write your own caption. We never post automatically.":"Facebook inakuruhusu kuandika maelezo yako mwenyewe. Hatuchapishi chochote kiotomatiki.","Copied. Paste it into your post.":"Imenakiliwa. Ibandike kwenye chapisho lako.","Select and copy the text below.":"Chagua na unakili maandishi yaliyo hapa chini.","Your question statistics":"Takwimu za maswali yako","Question comparisons are not available yet. Your personal statistics are shown below.":"Ulinganisho wa maswali bado haupatikani. Takwimu zako binafsi zinaonyeshwa hapa chini.","Times count visible, focused question time up to your last answer. For unanswered questions, time spent is shown. Hidden tabs and closed pages do not count. Earlier attempts may have no timings.":"Muda unaohesabiwa ni ule uliotumika wakati swali likiwa wazi na unalolizingatia, hadi wakati wa jibu lako la mwisho. Kwa maswali ambayo hayakujibiwa, muda uliotumika unaonyeshwa. Vichupo vilivyofichwa na kurasa zilizofungwa havihesabiwi. Jaribio la awali linaweza lisiwe na rekodi ya muda.","All 36 questions, including skipped questions":"Maswali yote 36, ikiwemo yale uliyoyaruka","Question":"Swali","Your time":"Muda wako","Correct-answer median":"Muda wa kati (median) kwa majibu sahihi","Others correct":"Wengine waliojibu kwa usahihi","Compare with voluntary attempts using the same puzzle version. At least 30 answered questions are needed for a correct rate, and 30 timed correct answers for a median. These are participants, not a representative population.":"Linganisha na majaribio ya hiari yaliyotumia toleo lilelile la fumbo. Angalau maswali 30 yaliyojibiwa yanahitajika ili kupata kiwango cha usahihi, na majibu sahihi 30 yenye rekodi ya muda yanahitajika ili kupata muda wa kati (median). Hawa ni washiriki tu, na si kundi linalowakilisha idadi kamili ya watu wote.","Compare and contribute":"Linganisha na uchangie","Help future participants compare their results. You can share anonymous test statistics after finishing, even if you skipped questions.":"Saidia washiriki wa baadaye kulinganisha matokeo yao. Unaweza kushiriki takwimu za jaribio bila kutaja jina baada ya kumaliza, hata kama uliacha baadhi ya maswali.","Anonymous comparisons are being prepared. Your personal statistics and sharing work without contributing.":"Ulinganisho usio na majina unaandaliwa. Takwimu zako binafsi na chaguo la kushiriki taarifa hizi hufanya kazi hata kama hutatoa data zako.","Age group (optional)":"Kundi la umri (hiari)","Country (optional)":"Nchi (hiari)","Prefer not to say":"Sitaki kusema","Under 18":"Chini ya miaka 18","I agree to contribute my anonymous question results and active times, together with any age group and country I choose, to comparison statistics.":"Nakubali kuchangia matokeo yangu ya maswali na muda niliotumia—bila kutaja jina langu—pamoja na kundi la umri na nchi nitakayochagua, ili viingie kwenye takwimu za ulinganisho.","No name, email or exact age. Sharing your statistics is optional and does not affect your result. Small comparison groups are hidden.":"Hakuna jina, barua pepe, wala umri kamili unaohitajika. Kushiriki takwimu zako ni hiari na hakuathiri matokeo yako. Makundi madogo ya ulinganisho yanafichwa.","Contribute anonymously":"Changia bila kutaja jina","Why this answer?":"Kwa nini jibu hili?","Explanation":"Ufafanuzi","The rule":"Kanuni","Applying the rule":"Kutumia kanuni","You are reviewing an older puzzle version. Its examples contain the previously identified ambiguity; your saved answer and score are unchanged.":"Unakagua toleo la zamani la fumbo hili. Mifano yake ina utata uliotambuliwa hapo awali; jibu lako lililohifadhiwa na alama zako hazijabadilika.","You are reviewing the original version, which contained incorrect example markers. Your saved answer and score are unchanged. New attempts use the corrected version.":"Unakagua toleo la asili, ambalo lilikuwa na alama za mifano zisizo sahihi. Jibu lako lililohifadhiwa na alama zako hazijabadilika. Majaribio mapya yanatumia toleo lililosahihishwa.","In this original version, the displayed middle picture expands to green at the top right and row 2, column 3; red at row 2, column 1; and brown at row 2, column 2, row 3, column 3 and row 4, column 3.":"Katika toleo hili la asili, picha ya katikati inayoonyeshwa inapanuka na kuwa ya rangi ya kijani upande wa juu kulia na katika mstari wa 2, safu ya 3; rangi nyekundu katika mstari wa 2, safu ya 1; na rangi ya kahawia katika mstari wa 2, safu ya 2, mstari wa 3, safu ya 3 na mstari wa 4, safu ya 3.","Share result on Facebook":"Shiriki matokeo kwenye Facebook","Share test on Facebook":"Shiriki jaribio kwenye Facebook","Estimated IQ":"Makadirio ya IQ","Just for fun. An approximate score, not a professionally validated IQ measurement.":"Kwa ajili ya burudani tu. Alama ya makadirio, si kipimo cha IQ kilichothibitishwa kitaalamu.","Your test is incomplete. Your correct answers are shown, but an IQ estimate needs all 36 answers.":"Jaribio lako halijakamilika. Majibu yako sahihi yanaonyeshwa, lakini ili kupata makadirio ya IQ, majibu yote 36 yanahitajika.","Unavailable":"Haipatikani","Free visual reasoning test | IQ Champion":"Jaribio la bure la hoja za kuona | IQ Champion","36 visual reasoning puzzles. Take a free 40-minute challenge and explore your results.":"Mafumbo 36 ya hoja za kuona. Shiriki katika changamoto ya bure ya dakika 40 na uone matokeo yako.","Answered":"Imejibiwa","Unanswered":"Haijajibiwa","Correct":"Sahihi","Incorrect":"Si sahihi","Close":"Funga","Help":"Msaada","40 min":"Dakika 40","Language":"Lugha","About the test":"Kuhusu jaribio hili","A challenge in visual reasoning":"Changamoto ya hoja za kuona","Spot the pattern.":"Tambua mtindo uliopo.","Find the missing piece.":"Tafuta kipande kinachokosekana.","36 visual puzzles and an estimated IQ score. Just for fun.":"Mafumbo 36 ya kuona na makadirio ya alama za IQ. Kwa ajili ya burudani tu.","Puzzles":"Mafumbo","Time limit":"Muda uliopangwa","Cost":"Gharama","Free":"Bure","No account needed. The timer starts when you begin.":"Huhitaji akaunti. Kipima muda huanza pale unapoanza jaribio.","How the test works":"Jinsi jaribio linavyofanya kazi","Choose the icon that completes each pattern.":"Chagua alama inayokamilisha kila mtindo.","Skip tricky questions and return using the overview.":"Ruka maswali magumu na uyarudie baadaye kwa kutumia muhtasari.","Review or change your answers before you finish.":"Kagua au badilisha majibu yako kabla ya kumaliza.","Your answers and start time are saved in this browser. Reloading keeps your original deadline.":"Majibu yako na muda ulioanza vinahifadhiwa kwenye kivinjari hiki. Kupakia upya ukurasa hakubadilishi muda wa mwisho uliopangwa awali.","The 40-minute timer continues while the page is closed. Unanswered questions count as incorrect.":"Kipima muda cha dakika 40 kinaendelea kuhesabu hata kama ukurasa umefungwa. Maswali ambayo hayajajibiwa huchukuliwa kuwa si sahihi.","About your result":"Kuhusu matokeo yako","Your estimated IQ is based on your position among":"Makadirio ya IQ yako yanatokana na nafasi yako miongoni mwa","historical attempts.":"majaribio yaliyofanyika hapo awali.","The comparison uses attempts lasting over one minute and up to 40 minutes. It has not been validated against an official IQ test or a representative population sample.":"Ulinganisho huu unahusisha majaribio yaliyochukua zaidi ya dakika moja hadi dakika 40. Matokeo haya hayajathibitishwa kwa kulinganishwa na kipimo rasmi cha IQ au sampuli ya watu inayowakilisha idadi ya watu kwa ujumla.","A test for fun. Your estimated IQ is an approximation, not a professionally validated IQ score.":"Jaribio la burudani. Makadirio ya IQ yako ni makadirio tu, na si alama ya IQ iliyothibitishwa kitaalamu.","Start 40-minute test":"Anza jaribio la dakika 40","Reasoning test":"Jaribio la mantiki","Your challenge":"Changamoto yako","Time remaining":"Muda uliosalia","remaining":"ulisalia","Question pattern":"Muundo wa swali","Find the pattern":"Tambua muundo","Four rows of visual patterns; complete the last row":"Safu nne za miundo ya kuona; kamilisha safu ya mwisho","Choose your answer":"Chagua jibu lako","Question navigation":"Urambazaji wa maswali","Previous question":"Swali lililopita","Skip for now":"Ruka kwa sasa","Next question":"Swali linalofuata","Question overview":"Muhtasari wa maswali","✓ Answered":"✓ Limejibiwa","○ Unanswered":"○ Halijajibiwa","Outline = current":"Imewekewa alama = swali la sasa","Jump to a question":"Nenda kwenye swali fulani","Review and finish":"Kagua na umalize","Instructions & saved progress":"Maelekezo na maendeleo yaliyohifadhiwa","Pick an answer to move to the next unanswered question. You can skip, return and change answers before finishing.":"Chagua jibu ili kuendelea kwenye swali linalofuata ambalo halijajibiwa. Unaweza kuruka swali, kurudi nyuma, na kubadilisha majibu kabla ya kumaliza.","Answers save automatically in this browser. Reloading resumes the same question; your timer keeps running.":"Majibu yanahifadhiwa kiotomatiki kwenye kivinjari hiki. Ukipakia upya ukurasa, utaendelea pale ulipoachia; kipima muda kitaendelea kufanya kazi.","Ready when you are":"Tuko tayari wakati wowote ukiwa tayari","Finish this test?":"Maliza jaribio hili?","Keep working":"Endelea kufanya kazi","Finish and see result":"Maliza na uone matokeo","Challenge complete":"Changamoto imekamilika","Your result":"Matokeo yako","Review answers":"Pitia majibu","Try again":"Jaribu tena","About this test":"Kuhusu jaribio hili","How to read this result":"Jinsi ya kusoma matokeo haya","Your percentile among historical attempts is converted to the familiar IQ scale: midpoint 100 and standard deviation 15. This assumes the comparison group reflects the population, which has not been established.":"Nafasi yako (asilimia ya watu uliowazidi) kulingana na majaribio ya awali imebadilishwa ili kulingana na kipimo cha kawaida cha IQ: ambapo wastani ni 100 na mchepuo wa kawaida ni 15. Hii inategemea dhana kwamba kundi lililotumika kwa kulinganisha linawakilisha idadi ya watu kwa ujumla, jambo ambalo halijathibitishwa.","Your answers, explained":"Maelezo ya majibu yako","Review your answers":"Pitia majibu yako","Back to result":"Rudi kwenye matokeo","The pattern":"Muundo","Compare the answers":"Linganisha majibu","Your answer":"Jibu lako","Correct answer":"Jibu sahihi","Previous review question":"Swali la awali la kupitia","Next review question":"Swali linalofuata la kupitia","Results by question":"Matokeo kwa kila swali","Explore all 36 puzzles":"Chunguza mafumbo yote 36","✓ Correct":"✓ Sahihi","× Incorrect":"× Si sahihi","Review a question":"Pitia swali","Your submitted answers and final score stay unchanged.":"Majibu uliyowasilisha na alama zako za mwisho hazitabadilika.","Contact":"Wasiliana","Feedback & contact":"Maoni na mawasiliano","Send feedback or contact us":"Tuma maoni au wasiliana nasi","Correct. Your answer matches the correct answer.":"Sahihi. Jibu lako linaendana na jibu sahihi.","Incorrect. Your answer differs from the correct answer.":"Si sahihi. Jibu lako ni tofauti na jibu sahihi.","Unanswered. No answer was submitted for this question.":"Halijajibiwa. Hakuna jibu lililowasilishwa kwa swali hili.","No answer submitted":"Hakuna jibu lililowasilishwa","Your submitted answer":"Jibu ulilowasilisha","Missing icon":"Aikoni haipo","All questions are answered. You can still review and change answers, then finish the test.":"Maswali yote yamejibiwa. Bado unaweza kupitia na kubadilisha majibu, kisha ukamilishe mtihani.","Five minutes or less remaining.":"Zimesalia dakika tano au chini ya hapo.","Time is up. Your answers have been scored.":"Muda umekwisha. Majibu yako yametathminiwa.","Test completed.":"Mtihani umekamilika.","Comparison unavailable.":"Ulinganisho haupatikani.","This browser could not save your attempt. Keep this page open: reloading may lose progress or restore older answers.":"Kivinjari hiki hakikuweza kuhifadhi jaribio lako. Acha ukurasa huu ukiwa wazi: kupakia upya ukurasa kunaweza kusababisha kupotea kwa maendeleo yako au kurejesha majibu ya awali.","Local saving is unavailable in this browser. Keep this page open to avoid losing your attempt.":"Uhifadhi wa ndani hauwezekani kwenye kivinjari hiki. Acha ukurasa huu ukiwa wazi ili kuepuka kupoteza jaribio lako.","The saved attempt could not be restored. Start a new test when you are ready.":"Jaribio lililohifadhiwa halikuweza kurejeshwa. Anza mtihani mpya utakapokuwa tayari.","Keep the figure unchanged":"Acha mchoro uwe kama ulivyo","Every position in each example row contains the same blue circle. Neither the shape, colour nor size changes.":"Kila nafasi katika safu ya mfano ina duara la bluu linalofanana. Umbo, rangi, na ukubwa havibadiliki.","The last row already contains two identical blue circles. Another identical blue circle completes it.":"Safu ya mwisho tayari ina miduara miwili ya bluu inayofanana. Duara lingine la bluu linalofanana na hayo linakamilisha safu hiyo.","Add one nested outline":"Ongeza umbo la nje lenye umbo lingine ndani yake","Moving right adds a smaller outline of the same shape inside the previous one. The outer shape and its colour stay unchanged.":"Kuelekea upande wa kulia, umbo dogo zaidi la aina ileile huongezwa ndani ya umbo la awali. Umbo la nje na rangi yake havibadiliki.","The green triangle has one inner triangle in the middle position. Add one more, smaller inner triangle to obtain the answer.":"Pembetatu ya kijani ina pembetatu nyingine ndani yake, katikati. Ongeza pembetatu nyingine ndogo zaidi ndani yake ili kupata jibu.","Use the first shape as a cut-out":"Tumia umbo la kwanza kama kiolezo cha kukata","The black shape in the first position is removed from the centre of the coloured square in the second position. The hole is white.":"Umbo jeusi lililo katika nafasi ya kwanza huondolewa kutoka katikati ya mraba wenye rangi uliopo katika nafasi ya pili. Nafasi iliyoachwa wazi ni nyeupe.","The black square makes a square hole in the green square. Choose the green square with the white square opening.":"Mraba mweusi hutengeneza tundu la mraba ndani ya mraba wa kijani. Chagua mraba wa kijani wenye tundu la mraba jeupe.","Combine the upper and lower colours":"Unganisha rangi za sehemu ya juu na ya chini","The result takes its upper half from the first capsule and its lower half from the second capsule.":"Matokeo yanaundwa kwa kuchukua nusu ya juu kutoka kwenye umbo la kwanza na nusu ya chini kutoka kwenye umbo la pili.","The first capsule is white and the second is blue, so the result is white above and blue below.":"Umbo la kwanza ni jeupe na la pili ni la bluu; hivyo, matokeo yake ni meupe kwa juu na ya bluu kwa chini.","Rotate the coloured lobes":"Zungusha sehemu zenye rangi","At each step, turn the whole four-lobed figure 90 degrees clockwise. Every red and blue lobe moves with the figure.":"Katika kila hatua, zungusha umbo zima lenye sehemu nne kwa nyuzi 90 kufuatia mwelekeo wa saa. Kila sehemu yenye rangi nyekundu au bluu huzunguka pamoja na umbo hilo.","Turn the middle figure another quarter-turn clockwise. The two red lobes finish on the right and at the bottom; the top and left lobes are blue.":"Zungusha umbo la katikati kwa robo mzunguko mwingine kufuatia mwelekeo wa saa. Sehemu mbili nyekundu huishia upande wa kulia na chini; sehemu za juu na za kushoto huwa za rangi ya bluu.","Round the corners progressively":"Fanya pembe ziwe za duara hatua kwa hatua","The colour and general shape remain the same while the corners become more rounded at each step.":"Rangi na umbo la jumla hubaki vilevile, huku pembe zikizidi kuwa za duara katika kila hatua.","Continue rounding the corners of the brown rectangle. The answer is the brown capsule with fully rounded ends.":"Endelea kuzungusha pembe za mstatili wa kahawia. Jibu ni umbo la kahawia lenye ncha zilizozungushwa kikamilifu.","Continue the circle’s movement":"Endeleza harakati za duara.","Within each row the green circle moves the same distance in the same direction: upward, downward or horizontally. Its size stays fixed.":"Katika kila safu, duara la kijani husogea umbali uleule katika mwelekeo uleule: juu, chini, au kwa mlalo. Ukubwa wake unabaki vilevile.","In the last row the circle moves left along the bottom of the square. One more equal step places it at the bottom left.":"Katika safu ya mwisho, duara husogea kuelekea kushoto kando ya sehemu ya chini ya mraba. Hatua nyingine moja ya ukubwa uleule huiweka katika kona ya chini kushoto.","Turn the entire dot pattern":"Zungusha muundo mzima wa nukta.","Rotate the square and all its dots 45 degrees counterclockwise at each step. The square becomes a diamond, then a square again.":"Zungusha mraba na nukta zake zote kwa nyuzi 45 kinyume na mwelekeo wa saa katika kila hatua. Mraba hubadilika na kuwa umbo la almasi, kisha hurudi kuwa mraba tena.","Turn the middle green-and-black diamond another 45 degrees counterclockwise. Keep the green and black dots in their rotated positions.":"Zungusha umbo la almasi la kijani na nyeusi lililopo katikati kwa nyuzi 45 nyingine kinyume na mwelekeo wa saa. Weka nukta za kijani na nyeusi katika nafasi zake mpya baada ya kuzungushwa.","Shorten each bar from the top":"Fupisha kila pau kutoka sehemu ya juu.","At every step, each vertical black bar loses one grid interval from its upper end. Its lower end stays on the bottom line. A bar disappears when its length reaches zero.":"Katika kila hatua, kila pau nyeusi iliyosimama hupungua kwa nafasi moja ya gridi kutoka ncha yake ya juu. Ncha yake ya chini inabaki kwenye mstari wa chini. Pau hupotea kabisa pale urefu wake unapofikia sifuri.","The middle picture has a one-interval middle bar and a two-interval right bar. The middle bar disappears, leaving a one-interval bar on the right.":"Picha ya katikati ina pau ya katikati yenye urefu wa nafasi moja na pau ya upande wa kulia yenye urefu wa nafasi mbili. Pau ya katikati hupotea, na kuacha pau ya nafasi moja upande wa kulia.","Reflect across the black line":"Onyesha taswira kioo (reflect) kupitia mstari mweusi.","The middle line is a mirror axis. Reflect the coloured shape in that line rather than simply rotating it.":"Mstari wa katikati hufanya kazi kama kioo. Onyesha taswira ya umbo lenye rangi kupitia mstari huo, badala ya kulizungusha tu.","The last mirror line is vertical, so the yellow shape is flipped left to right. Its colour and size remain unchanged.":"Mstari wa mwisho wa kioo umesimama wima, hivyo umbo la manjano hugeuzwa kutoka kushoto kwenda kulia. Rangi na ukubwa wake vinabaki vilevile.","Overlay the shapes and use the first colour":"Weka maumbo juu ya mengine na utumie rangi ya umbo la kwanza.","Place both shapes on top of one another. Keep the combined silhouette and the visible outlines, but colour the result with the first shape’s colour.":"Weka maumbo yote mawili juu ya kila mmoja. Dumisha umbo la nje lililounganishwa pamoja na mistari ya mipaka inayoonekana, lakini paka rangi matokeo hayo kwa kutumia rangi ya umbo la kwanza.","Overlay the blue downward triangle and the yellow hexagon, then use blue for the combined figure. The triangle’s projecting tips remain visible around the hexagon.":"Weka pembetatu ya bluu inayoelekea chini juu ya heksagoni ya manjano, kisha tumia rangi ya bluu kwa umbo lililounganishwa. Ncha za pembetatu zinazochomoza hubakia kuonekana kuzunguka heksagoni hiyo.","Keep green in exactly one input":"Weka rangi ya kijani katika ingizo moja pekee.","Compare corresponding areas of the two squares. An area is green if it is green in exactly one input. Green in both cancels to white; white in both stays white.":"Linganisha maeneo yanayolingana katika mraba miwili. Eneo huwa la kijani ikiwa lina rangi ya kijani katika ingizo moja pekee. Rangi ya kijani katika maeneo yote mawili hubadilika kuwa nyeupe; rangi nyeupe katika maeneo yote mawili hubakia nyeupe.","The first square is entirely green and the second has only a green bottom-left quarter. That shared quarter turns white; the other three quarters stay green.":"Mraba wa kwanza ni wa kijani kabisa, na mraba wa pili una sehemu ya kijani katika robo ya chini kushoto pekee. Robo hiyo ya pamoja hubadilika kuwa nyeupe; robo nyingine tatu hubakia za kijani.","Attach a copy at every corner":"Ambatisha nakala katika kila kona.","Put a copy of the small black symbol at each vertex of the large shape. The added copies take the large shape’s colour.":"Weka nakala ya alama ndogo nyeusi kwenye kila ncha ya umbo kubwa. Nakala hizo zilizoongezwa huchukua rangi ya umbo kubwa.","The large blue diamond has four corners. Add a blue downward triangle at each corner, following the same placement rule as the examples.":"Umbo kubwa la almasi la bluu lina pembe nne. Ongeza pembetatu ya bluu inayoelekea chini kwenye kila pembe, ukifuata kanuni ileile ya uwekaji kama inavyoonekana kwenye mifano.","Add corresponding bar heights":"Jumlisha urefu wa pau zinazolingana.","For each of the three horizontal positions, add the black bar’s height in the first picture to its height in the second. Measure upwards from the common bottom line.":"Kwa kila moja ya nafasi tatu za mlalo, jumlisha urefu wa pau nyeusi katika picha ya kwanza na urefu wake katika picha ya pili. Pima kuelekea juu kuanzia mstari wa pamoja wa chini.","Neither input has a left bar. The two middle bars add to a full-height bar, while the right bars add to a shorter bar. The answer has just those middle and right bars.":"Hakuna ingizo lenye pau upande wa kushoto. Pau mbili za katikati zinapojumlishwa hutengeneza pau yenye urefu kamili, huku pau za upande wa kulia zikitengeneza pau fupi zaidi. Jibu linajumuisha pau hizo za katikati na za upande wa kulia pekee.","Rotate and alternate colours":"Zungusha na ubadilishe rangi kwa kupokezana.","Turn the shape 45 degrees counterclockwise at each step. Its colour alternates, so the third picture returns to the first picture’s colour.":"Zungusha umbo kwa nyuzi 45 kinyume na mwelekeo wa saa katika kila hatua. Rangi yake hubadilika-badilika, hivyo picha ya tatu inarudi kwenye rangi ya picha ya kwanza.","Turn the white middle shape another 45 degrees counterclockwise and restore the dark colour from the first picture. Choose the dark curved shape in that orientation.":"Zungusha umbo jeupe la katikati kwa nyuzi 45 nyingine kinyume na mwelekeo wa saa na urejeshe rangi nyeusi iliyokuwepo kwenye picha ya kwanza. Chagua umbo jeusi lililojikunja katika mwelekeo huo.","Combine the black circles":"Unganisha duara nyeusi","A circle is black in the result whenever the matching circle is black in either input. It is white only when both inputs have a white circle there.":"Duara huwa nyeusi katika matokeo ikiwa duara husika ni nyeusi katika mojawapo ya michoro ya awali. Huwa nyeupe tu pale ambapo michoro yote miwili ina duara nyeupe katika nafasi hiyo.","The first input contributes the bottom-right black circle; the second contributes the two top black circles. The centre and bottom-left circle stay white.":"Mchoro wa kwanza unachangia duara nyeusi iliyo upande wa chini kulia; mchoro wa pili unachangia duara mbili nyeusi zilizo juu. Duara ya katikati na ile ya chini kushoto hubaki nyeupe.","Expand into neighbouring cells":"Panua hadi kwenye seli jirani","At each step, every blue cell remains blue and also colours its immediate neighbours above, below, left and right. Expansion stops at the grid boundary.":"Katika kila hatua, kila seli ya bluu hubaki ya bluu na pia huweka rangi ya bluu kwenye seli zake jirani za moja kwa moja—juu, chini, kushoto, na kulia. Upanuzi huishia kwenye mipaka ya gridi.","Apply the same one-cell expansion to the middle blue region. Newly reached side neighbours become blue; cells farther away remain in the grey-and-black checkerboard.":"Tumia upanuzi huo huo wa seli moja kwenye eneo la bluu la katikati. Seli jirani za pembeni zilizofikiwa sasa zinakuwa za bluu; seli zilizo mbali zaidi hubaki katika muundo wa miraba ya kijivu na nyeusi.","Cancel matching brown positions":"Ondoa nafasi za rangi ya kahawia zinazolingana","Compare the two five-cell strips position by position. A cell is brown in the result if exactly one input is brown there. Matching brown cells cancel to blue.":"Linganisha safu mbili zenye seli tano, nafasi kwa nafasi. Seli huwa ya rangi ya kahawia katika matokeo ikiwa ni mchoro mmoja tu kati ya miwili una rangi ya kahawia katika nafasi hiyo. Seli za rangi ya kahawia zinazolingana hubadilika na kuwa za bluu.","Brown occurs in positions 2, 3, 4 and 5 in the first strip and in positions 2, 3 and 5 in the second. Only position 4 remains brown.":"Rangi ya kahawia inapatikana katika nafasi ya 2, 3, 4, na 5 kwenye safu ya kwanza, na katika nafasi ya 2, 3, na 5 kwenye safu ya pili. Ni nafasi ya 4 pekee inayobaki na rangi ya kahawia.","Remove the closest red dots":"Ondoa nukta nyekundu zilizo karibu zaidi","Find the smallest distance between any two red dots. Remove every red dot belonging to a pair at that distance. Recalculate the closest distance for the next step.":"Tafuta umbali mdogo zaidi kati ya nukta zozote mbili nyekundu. Ondoa kila nukta nyekundu ambayo ni sehemu ya jozi iliyo katika umbali huo. Hesabu upya umbali mdogo zaidi kwa ajili ya hatua inayofuata.","In the middle picture, the three lower red dots participate in the closest diagonal pairs. Removing them leaves only the red dot in the top row, fourth column.":"Katika picha ya katikati, nukta tatu nyekundu za chini ni sehemu ya jozi za kimstari wa mlalo-wima (diagonal) zilizo karibu zaidi. Ukiziondoa, inabaki nukta nyekundu moja tu iliyo katika safu ya juu, safu wima ya nne.","Move the six colours around a cycle":"Zungusha rangi hizo sita katika mzunguko.","Read down the left stack, then down the right stack. Shift every colour one position forward in that six-position cycle; the bottom-right colour wraps to the top left.":"Soma kuanzia juu kwenda chini kwenye safu ya kushoto, kisha ufanye vivyo hivyo kwa safu ya kulia. Sogeza kila rangi nafasi moja mbele katika mzunguko huo wa nafasi sita; rangi iliyo chini kulia inahamia juu kushoto.","From the middle picture, the bottom-right brown circle wraps to the top left. The final stacks are brown/red/red on the left and black/brown/blue on the right.":"Kutoka kwenye picha ya katikati, duara la kahawia lililo chini kulia linahamia juu kushoto. Safu za mwisho zinakuwa: kahawia/nyekundu/nyekundu upande wa kushoto, na nyeusi/kahawia/bluu upande wa kulia.","Move white and black in opposite directions":"Sogeza duara nyeupe na nyeusi katika pande zinazoelekea kinyume","White circles move one corner clockwise and black circles move one corner counterclockwise at each step. Grey means that a white and a black circle occupy the same corner; separate them before moving again.":"Duara nyeupe husogea kona moja kufuatia mwelekeo wa saa, na duara nyeusi husogea kona moja kinyume na mwelekeo wa saa katika kila hatua. Rangi ya kijivu inaashiria kuwa duara nyeupe na nyeusi zinakaa kwenye kona moja; zitenganishe kabla ya kusogeza tena.","The middle picture contains white circles at the two left corners and black circles at the two left corners and bottom right. Moving them gives white at top left, grey at top right, and black at both bottom corners.":"Picha ya katikati ina duara nyeupe kwenye kona mbili za kushoto, na duara nyeusi kwenye kona mbili za kushoto pamoja na kona ya chini kulia. Kuzisogeza kunasababisha duara nyeupe kuwa juu kushoto, kijivu juu kulia, na nyeusi kwenye kona zote mbili za chini.","Extend every horizontal stroke":"Panua kila mstari wa mlalo","At each step, extend each black horizontal stroke into the immediately neighbouring capsule on both sides. Existing strokes remain, and strokes stop at the outside edges.":"Katika kila hatua, panua kila mstari mweusi wa mlalo hadi kwenye sehemu (kapsuli) iliyo karibu nayo moja kwa moja, pande zote mbili. Mistari iliyopo inabaki, na mistari huishia kwenye kingo za nje.","Extend the strokes in the middle picture one more capsule left and right. Keep separate stroke heights distinct; the answer shows the resulting longer horizontal lines across the four capsules.":"Panua mistari iliyo kwenye picha ya katikati kwa sehemu (kapsuli) moja zaidi kuelekea kushoto na kulia. Dumisha tofauti kati ya urefu wa mistari mbalimbali; jibu linaonyesha mistari mirefu ya mlalo inayotokea katika sehemu hizo nne.","Grow the triangular lattice":"Panua mtandao wa pembetatu","Treat the drawing as a group of small triangles. At each step, add a small triangle just outside every exposed edge, keeping the existing triangles and their connecting lines.":"Chukulia mchoro huo kama mkusanyiko wa pembetatu ndogo. Katika kila hatua, ongeza pembetatu ndogo nje ya kila ukingo ulio wazi, huku ukibakiza pembetatu zilizopo na mistari inayounganisha pembetatu hizo.","Grow the middle green cluster by one more layer of neighbouring triangles. The answer keeps the same triangular grid and adds the triangles along its outside edges.":"Panua kundi la kijani lililo katikati kwa kuongeza safu nyingine ya pembetatu zilizo karibu nalo. Jibu linadumisha mtandao uleule wa pembetatu na kuongeza pembetatu nyingine kando ya kingo zake za nje.","Remove the marked vertices":"Odoa ncha zilizowekwa alama","The brown dots identify vertices of the black polygon to remove. Connect the remaining vertices in their original order. Two remaining vertices produce a line segment.":"Doti za kahawia zinaonyesha ncha za poligoni nyeusi zinazopaswa kuondolewa. Unganisha ncha zilizobaki kwa mpangilio wake wa asili. Ncha mbili zilizobaki hutengeneza sehemu ya mstari.","Remove the top and left vertices marked by the brown dots. Only the two lower vertices remain, so the answer is the short horizontal line near the bottom right.":"Odoa ncha za juu na za kushoto zilizowekwa alama na doti za kahawia. Ni ncha mbili za chini pekee ndizo zinazobaki, hivyo jibu ni mstari mfupi wa mlalo karibu na sehemu ya chini kulia.","Toggle the dots at the outline’s corners":"Badilisha hali ya doti kwenye pembe za umbo la nje","Match the black outline’s vertices to the 3-by-3 dot positions. At each vertex, remove an existing blue dot or add one if the position is empty. Other positions stay unchanged.":"Linganisha ncha za umbo jeusi la nje na nafasi za doti katika mpangilio wa 3 kwa 3. Kwenye kila ncha, ondoa doti ya bluu iliyopo, au ongeza doti ikiwa nafasi hiyo haina kitu. Nafasi nyingine hubaki vilevile.","Toggle the four corner positions of the slanted outline. The result has blue dots at top left and top middle, middle middle and middle right, and all three bottom positions.":"Badilisha hali ya doti katika pembe nne za umbo lililoelemea. Matokeo yake ni doti za bluu katika sehemu ya juu kushoto na juu katikati, katikati na katikati kulia, pamoja na nafasi zote tatu za chini.","Remove the marked brick and its neighbours":"Odoa tofali lililowekwa alama pamoja na matofali yanayolizunguka","First remove the red brick and every brick sharing an edge with it, then let unsupported bricks fall straight down. Repeat the same process with the yellow brick.":"Kwanza, ondoa tofali jekundu na matofali yote yanayogusana nalo, kisha acha matofali yasiyokuwa na tegemeo yaanguke moja kwa moja chini. Rudia mchakato huo huo kwa tofali la manjano.","After the red removal, the remaining bricks form the middle staircase. Removing the yellow brick and its touching neighbours leaves the upper blue brick, which falls to the bottom.":"Baada ya kuondoa matofali mekundu, matofali yaliyobaki yanaunda ngazi ya katikati. Kuondoa tofali la njano pamoja na yale yanayoligusa kunaacha tofali la bluu la juu, ambalo huanguka hadi chini kabisa.","Cycle the layers and apply the colour mask":"Zungusha tabaka mbalimbali na utumie kigezo cha rangi (colour mask).","Track the same three shapes. At each step the front shape goes to the back. For the final picture, keep the middle picture’s grey or black fills; its unfilled white shapes regain their colours from the first picture.":"Fuatilia maumbo hayo matatu. Katika kila hatua, umbo lililo mbele huhamia nyuma. Kwa picha ya mwisho, weka sehemu zilizojazwa rangi ya kijivu au nyeusi kutoka kwenye picha ya katikati; maumbo meupe ambayo hayakujazwa rangi yanarudishiwa rangi zake kutoka kwenye picha ya kwanza.","The grey hexagon comes to the front, the black horizontal capsule lies behind it, and the vertical capsule moves to the back. That white vertical capsule regains its original yellow colour.":"Umbo la pembe sita la kijivu linakuja mbele, umbo la duaradufu (capsule) la rangi nyeusi lililolala linakaa nyuma yake, na umbo la duaradufu lililosimama linahamia nyuma kabisa. Umbo hilo jeupe lililosimama linarejea kwenye rangi yake ya asili ya njano.","Use each circle’s colour to find its motion":"Tumia rangi ya kila duara kubaini mwendo wake.","Track each circle relative to the circle immediately around it. White moves 90 degrees clockwise, black moves 90 degrees counterclockwise, and red stays in the same relative position. Blue does not move. Apply these movements to every nested level.":"Fuatilia kila duara kwa kulinganisha na duara linalolizunguka moja kwa moja. Duara jeupe linasogea digrii 90 kufuatia mwelekeo wa saa, duara jeusi linasogea digrii 90 kinyume na mwelekeo wa saa, na duara jekundu linabaki katika nafasi ileile. Duara la bluu halisogei. Tekeleza miondoko hii katika kila ngazi ya duara zilizowekwa ndani ya nyingine.","The black circle moves from above the blue circle to its left. Red stays to the right inside black. The larger white circle moves from above red to its right; the smallest white circle moves from below the larger white circle to its left.":"Duara jeusi linahama kutoka juu ya duara la bluu kwenda upande wake wa kushoto. Duara jekundu linabaki upande wa kulia ndani ya duara jeusi. Duara jeupe kubwa linahama kutoka juu ya duara jekundu kwenda upande wake wa kulia; duara jeupe dogo zaidi linahama kutoka chini ya duara jeupe kubwa kwenda upande wake wa kushoto.","Move colours along the connected routes":"Sogeza rangi kando ya njia zilizounganishwa.","The black links specify the routes along which the colours move. Follow each loop clockwise, moving each colour to the next connected position. A two-position route swaps its colours; unconnected dots stay put.":"Mistari myeusi inaonyesha njia ambazo rangi hufuata wakati wa kusogea. Fuata kila mzunguko kulingana na mwelekeo wa saa, ukisogeza kila rangi hadi kwenye nafasi inayofuata iliyounganishwa. Njia inayounganisha nafasi mbili husababisha rangi kubadilishana nafasi; nukta ambazo hazijaunganishwa hubaki pale zilipo.","Swap the two top colours. On the lower loop, the left-middle blue moves to the centre and the right-middle red moves to the bottom left. The unconnected bottom-right red stays unchanged.":"Badilishana rangi mbili za juu. Kwenye mzunguko wa chini, rangi ya bluu iliyo katikati-kushoto inahamia katikati, na rangi nyekundu iliyo katikati-kulia inahamia chini-kushoto. Rangi nyekundu iliyo chini-kulia, ambayo haijaunganishwa na nyingine, inabaki bila kubadilika.","Move each colour along its own path":"Sogeza kila rangi kwenye njia yake yenyewe","Red moves down, green moves right and yellow moves left. Blue moves up and, where possible, one column left. White marks overlapping colours; separate those colours again when applying the next move. Colours moving beyond the grid disappear.":"Rangi nyekundu inasogea chini, kijani inasogea kulia, na njano inasogea kushoto. Bluu inasogea juu na, inapowezekana, inasogea safu moja kuelekea kushoto. Rangi nyeupe inaashiria rangi zinazoingiliana; zitenganishe rangi hizo tena kabla ya kufanya hatua inayofuata. Rangi zinazosogea nje ya gridi hupotea.","Separate the middle white cell into red and green. Red moves to bottom middle, green to middle right, blue reaches top left and yellow exits on the left. Those three coloured cells form the answer.":"Gawanya sehemu nyeupe iliyo katikati katika rangi nyekundu na kijani. Nyekundu inasogea katikati chini, kijani inasogea katikati kulia, bluu inafika juu kushoto, na njano inatoka upande wa kushoto. Sehemu hizo tatu zenye rangi ndiyo jibu.","Move red and blue tips in opposite directions":"Sogeza ncha nyekundu na bluu katika pande zinazoelekea kinyume","At each step, every red tip moves one position counterclockwise and every blue tip moves two positions clockwise around the five-pointed star. White means that red and blue overlap; separate both colours before moving again.":"Katika kila hatua, kila ncha nyekundu inasogea nafasi moja kinyume na mwelekeo wa saa, na kila ncha ya bluu inasogea nafasi mbili kulingana na mwelekeo wa saa kuzunguka nyota yenye ncha tano. Rangi nyeupe inaashiria kuwa nyekundu na bluu zimeingiliana; zitenganishe rangi zote mbili kabla ya kusogeza tena.","In the middle picture, red is at the lower right and blue is at the upper right and upper left. The next move puts red and one blue together at the upper right, making it white. The other blue moves to the lower left.":"Katika picha ya katikati, nyekundu iko chini kulia, na bluu iko juu kulia na juu kushoto. Hatua inayofuata inaziweka nyekundu na moja ya bluu pamoja juu kulia, na kuzifanya ziwe nyeupe. Bluu nyingine inasogea chini kushoto.","Shift two copies in the sector’s directions":"Sogeza nakala mbili kulingana na mwelekeo wa sekta hiyo","The two edges of the white sector indicate two movement directions. Make two copies of the red-dot pattern and shift one copy one grid step in each direction, wrapping at the edges. A position reached once is red; a position reached by both copies is blue.":"Kingo mbili za sekta nyeupe zinaonyesha pande mbili za usogezaji. Tengeneza nakala mbili za muundo wenye nukta nyekundu, kisha sogeza nakala moja hatua moja kwenye gridi katika kila mwelekeo, huku ikijirudisha upande mwingine inapofika kwenye kingo. Nafasi inayofikiwa na nakala moja inakuwa nyekundu; nafasi inayofikiwa na nakala zote mbili inakuwa bluu.","The final sector points down-left and down-right. Shift a copy each way. Their overlap makes the entire top row and the centre blue; the single-copy positions remain red, as shown in the answer.":"Sekta ya mwisho inaelekea chini-kushoto na chini-kulia. Sogeza nakala moja katika kila mwelekeo. Pale zinapoingiliana, safu nzima ya juu na sehemu ya katikati zinakuwa bluu; nafasi zilizofikiwa na nakala moja tu zinabaki nyekundu, kama inavyoonyeshwa kwenye jibu.","Remove crossing string segments":"Odoa sehemu za nyuzi zinazokatiza","Overlay both drawings. Treat each straight piece between successive grid dots as a separate string segment. When a segment from one drawing crosses a segment from the other between dots, remove both segments. Segments meeting at a grid dot stay. Keep all uncut segments from both drawings.":"Weka michoro yote miwili juu ya mwingine. Chukulia kila sehemu iliyonyooka kati ya nukta mbili mfululizo kwenye gridi kama kipande tofauti cha uzi. Ikiwa kipande kutoka mchoro mmoja kinakatiza kipande kutoka mchoro mwingine kati ya nukta hizo, ondoa vipande vyote viwili. Sehemu zinazokutana kwenye nukta ya gridi hubaki. Hifadhi sehemu zote ambazo hazikukatwa kutoka kwenye michoro yote miwili.","Remove the diagonal segments cut between the grid dots. The remaining pieces form an upper fork with a vertical stem, two detached short diagonals near the top corners, and a lower fork with its own vertical stem.":"Ondoa sehemu za mlalo-mteremko (diagonal) zilizokatwa kati ya nukta za gridi. Vipande vilivyobaki vinaunda umbo la uma la juu lenye shina la wima, vipande viwili vifupi vya mlalo-mteremko vilivyojitenga karibu na pembe za juu, na umbo la uma la chini lenye shina lake la wima.","Slide and sort the pieces by size":"Telezesha na panga vipande kulingana na ukubwa wake.","Push all pieces in the arrow’s direction. Smaller pieces pass larger pieces and reach the furthest available spaces first. Keep every piece’s height and vertical position. Pieces may share a column if they do not overlap vertically; equal-sized pieces keep their relative order.":"Sukuma vipande vyote kuelekea upande unaoonyeshwa na mshale. Vipande vidogo hupita vile vikubwa na kufika kwenye nafasi za mbali zaidi kwanza. Dumisha urefu na nafasi ya wima ya kila kipande. Vipande vinaweza kuwa katika safu wima moja ikiwa havipishani kwa wima; vipande vyenye ukubwa sawa hudumisha mpangilio wake wa awali.","The arrow points right. Fit the shortest pieces into the available spaces on the right, then the two-cell pieces, then the taller pieces to their left. Nothing moves up or down, and no piece changes size.":"Mshale unaelekea kulia. Weka vipande vifupi zaidi kwenye nafasi zilizo wazi upande wa kulia, ikifuatiwa na vipande vyenye ukubwa wa seli mbili, kisha vipande virefu zaidi upande wao wa kushoto. Hakuna kipande kinachosogea juu au chini, na hakuna kipande kinachobadilisha ukubwa wake.","Move the dividers into free spaces":"Hamisha vizuizi (dividers) kwenye nafasi zilizo wazi.","All black dividers simultaneously move one position to the right if the next position contains a yellow bead. A divider blocked by another divider waits. The right edge connects to the left edge.":"Vigawanyaji vyote vyeusi husogea kwa pamoja nafasi moja kuelekea kulia ikiwa nafasi inayofuata ina shanga ya njano. Kigawanyaji kinachozuiwa na kigawanyaji kingine husubiri. Ukingo wa kulia unaunganishwa na ukingo wa kushoto.","Apply one simultaneous step to the middle sequence. The final order is divider, bead, divider, bead, divider, divider, bead.":"Fanya hatua moja ya pamoja kwenye mfuatano wa katikati. Mpangilio wa mwisho ni: kigawanyaji, shanga, kigawanyaji, shanga, kigawanyaji, kigawanyaji, shanga.","Expand the colours and keep the largest group":"Panua rangi hizo na ubaki na kundi kubwa zaidi.","Replace every coloured ball with four new balls of the same colour, one step above, below, left and right. Balls leaving the grid disappear. At each position, keep the colour with the largest number of arriving balls. If colours tie for the largest number, leave the position empty. Several arrivals of the same colour appear as one coloured marker.":"Badilisha kila mpira wenye rangi kwa mipira minne mipya ya rangi hiyo hiyo, ikiwa imewekwa hatua moja juu, chini, kushoto, na kulia. Mipira inayotoka nje ya gridi hupotea. Katika kila nafasi, weka rangi yenye idadi kubwa zaidi ya mipira inayofika hapo. Ikiwa kuna rangi zinazolingana kwa idadi kubwa zaidi, acha nafasi hiyo ikiwa tupu. Mipira kadhaa ya rangi moja inayofika kwenye nafasi moja huonekana kama alama moja ya rangi hiyo.","Expanding the displayed middle picture leaves green at the top right and at row 2, column 3; red at row 2, column 1; and brown at row 2, column 2, row 3, column 3, and row 4, columns 2, 3 and 4. Those are exactly the colours and positions in the stored answer.":"Kupanua picha ya katikati inayoonyeshwa kunaacha rangi ya kijani upande wa juu kulia na katika safu ya 2, safu wima ya 3; rangi nyekundu katika safu ya 2, safu wima ya 1; na rangi ya kahawia katika safu ya 2, safu wima ya 2; safu ya 3, safu wima ya 3; na safu ya 4, safu wima za 2, 3, na 4. Hizo ndizo hasa rangi na nafasi zilizopo kwenye jibu lililohifadhiwa.","Choose language":"Chagua lugha","Search languages":"Tafuta lugha","Close language selector":"Funga kiteua lugha","No languages found":"Hakuna lugha zilizopatikana","Free IQ test for fun | IQ Champion":"Jaribio la IQ la bure kwa ajili ya burudani | IQ Champion","A free IQ-style test for fun: 36 visual puzzles, 40 minutes, saved progress and an estimated IQ result. No account needed.":"Jaribio la bure la mtindo wa IQ kwa ajili ya burudani: mafumbo 36 ya kuona, dakika 40, maendeleo yaliyohifadhiwa, na makadirio ya matokeo ya IQ. Huhitaji akaunti.","Choose your preferred language. Your answers and original deadline stay saved.":"Chagua lugha unayopendelea. Majibu yako na muda wa mwisho wa awali vitabaki vimehifadhiwa.","Loading language…":"Inapakia lugha…","The language could not be loaded. Your test and answers are unchanged.":"Lugha haikuweza kupakiwa. Jaribio lako na majibu yako hayajabadilika.","Feedback is available in Danish and English.":"Maoni yanapatikana kwa Kidenmark na Kiingereza.","Shared achievement":"Mafanikio yaliyoshirikiwa","Shared result":"Matokeo yaliyoshirikiwa","Shared results are self-reported.":"Matokeo yaliyoshirikiwa yanaripotiwa na wahusika wenyewe.","Shared achievements are self-reported. No age, country, answers or personal profiles are shared.":"Mafanikio yaliyoshirikiwa yanaripotiwa na wahusika wenyewe. Hakuna taarifa kuhusu umri, nchi, majibu, au wasifu binafsi zinazoshirikiwa.","Try the 36 puzzles yourself":"Jaribu mafumbo hayo 36 mwenyewe","Try the test yourself":"Jaribu mtihani huo mwenyewe","A visual challenge in IQ Champion. Can you spot the pattern too?":"Changamoto ya kuona katika IQ Champion. Je, unaweza kugundua mtindo huo pia?","A free visual puzzle test, just for fun. Not a professionally validated IQ measurement.":"Jaribio la mafumbo ya kuona la bure, kwa ajili ya burudani tu. Si kipimo cha IQ kilichothibitishwa kitaalamu.","Page not found":"Ukurasa haukupatikana","You can continue in another language.":"Unaweza kuendelea katika lugha nyingine.","answered":"imejibiwa","unanswered":"haijajibiwa","correct":"sahihi","incorrect":"si sahihi","IQ Champion":"IQ Champion","IQCHAMPION":"IQCHAMPION","English":"English","Dansk":"Dansk"},"templates":{"Estimated median range: {0} ({1} timed correct answers).":"Makadirio ya kiwango cha kati: {0} (majibu sahihi {1} yaliyotolewa ndani ya muda uliowekwa).","Question {0} · {1}":"Swali {0} · {1}","{0} correct patterns":"Mitindo sahihi {0}","Active time: {0}":"Muda uliotumika: {0}","Comparison: {0} voluntary attempts over {1} days.":"Ulinganisho: Majaribio {0} ya hiari katika kipindi cha siku {1}.","Question {0} / {1}":"Swali {0} / {1}","Review question {0} / {1}":"Kagua swali {0} / {1}","Row {0}, icon {1}":"Mstari {0}, ikoni {1}","Answer {0}":"Jibu {0}","Question {0}, {1}":"Swali {0}, {1}","Review question {0}, {1}":"Kagua swali {0}, {1}","{0} correct; {1} incorrect; {2} unanswered.":"{0} sahihi; {1} si sahihi; {2} hazikujibiwa.","{0} answered; {1} unanswered.":"{0} zimejibiwa; {1} hazikujibiwa.","{0} answered; {1} unanswered. Unanswered questions count as incorrect. Once finished, you cannot change answers.":"{0} zimejibiwa; {1} hazikujibiwa. Maswali yasiyojibiwa huhesabiwa kama makosa. Ukishamaliza, huwezi kubadilisha majibu.","{0} / {1} correct":"{0} / {1} sahihi","Percentile among historical participants: {0}":"Nafasi ya asilimia (percentile) miongoni mwa washiriki wa awali: {0}","Participants scoring lower: {0}%. Participants with the same score: {1}%.":"Washiriki waliopata alama za chini: {0}%. Washiriki waliopata alama sawa: {1}%.","Reference group: {0} historical attempts. Attempts with recorded durations over one minute and up to 40 minutes are included. Tied scores share the midpoint of their percentile group. Estimates are rounded to whole numbers and displayed only within 55–145, with a limit indicator outside that range. This is a scale conversion, not an independently validated population IQ measurement. Practice and repeated attempts can affect your result. Some example images have been corrected since the historical attempts were collected, which limits comparability.":"Kundi la kulinganisha: {0} majaribio ya awali. Majaribio yaliyochukua muda wa zaidi ya dakika moja hadi dakika 40 yamejumuishwa. Alama zinazolingana huwekwa kwenye sehemu ya katikati ya kundi lao la asilimia. Makadirio yamezungushwa kuwa namba kamili na kuonyeshwa ndani ya kiwango cha 55–145 pekee, huku kukiwa na kiashirio ikiwa matokeo yako nje ya kiwango hicho. Hii ni ubadilishaji wa kipimo, na si kipimo cha IQ cha idadi ya watu kilichothibitishwa kivyake. Mazoezi na kujaribu mara kwa mara kunaweza kuathiri matokeo yako. Baadhi ya picha za mfano zimesahihishwa tangu data za majaribio ya awali zilipokusanywa, jambo linalopunguza uwezekano wa kulinganisha matokeo.","My estimated IQ in IQ Champion: {0}. Just for fun. Try it: {1}":"Makadirio ya IQ yangu katika IQ Champion: {0}. Kwa ajili ya burudani tu. Jaribu mwenyewe: {1}","I solved question {0} correctly in {1}. Can you do it too? {2}":"Nimetatua swali namba {0} kwa usahihi ndani ya {1}. Je, unaweza kufanya hivyo pia? {2}","I solved question {0} correctly in {1} (estimated median among correct answers: {2}). Can you do it too? {3}":"Nimetatua swali namba {0} kwa usahihi ndani ya {1} (makadirio ya wastani wa kati miongoni mwa majibu sahihi: {2}). Je, unaweza kufanya hivyo pia? {3}","I found {0} correct patterns in IQ Champion. Try it: {1}":"Nimegundua mifumo {0} sahihi katika IQ Champion. Jaribu mwenyewe: {1}","Can you find the missing patterns in IQ Champion? {0}":"Je, unaweza kugundua mifumo inayokosekana katika IQ Champion? {0}","Question {0} solved":"Swali namba {0} limetatuliwa","{0} patterns solved":"Mifumo {0} imetatuliwa","{0} / 36 correct. {1}":"{0} / 36 sahihi. {1}","Estimated IQ {0} | IQ Champion":"IQ Iliyokadiriwa {0} | IQ Champion"},"status":"translated"};
